# Every optional check. The one that earns its place here is SC2312: a failing
# command inside $(...) passed as an argument does not trip `set -e`, which is
# the same exit-0-but-wrong shape AGENTS.md warns about for `cmd | tail`. The
# rest (braces on every variable, a default case) are style, taken for
# consistency rather than picked one by one.
enable=all
